## Problem Understanding

1. We have workers with skills and stations that support certain skills
2. Each worker must be assigned to a station with the same skill
3. The station indices must be strictly increasing (consecutive workers get assigned to stations in order)
4. We want to maximize the maximum gap between consecutive worker assignments
5. The gap is the maximum difference between consecutive station indices

